  "prompt": "For a last-seen report: in which month did each customer place their latest order, and how many customers is that per month? order_ts holds UTC time; the month is the first day of the UTC month of the latest order's order_ts. Orders with a missing customer_id are guest orders and do not count. Each customer counts once. When two orders of a customer tie on order_ts, the lower order_id is kept. Return two columns, in this order: last_order_month and customers. Return one row for each month that holds some customer's latest order. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "last_order_month",
        "type_class": "temporal"
      },
      {
        "name": "customers",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      }
    ],
    "grain": null
  },
